# ---- Secrets: never commit. Copy .env.example -> .env on each machine. ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*credentials*.json
*token*.json

# ---- Companion repos (they have their own GitHub repos, linked as submodules) ----
